# Root .env holds your local overrides (incl. the Keycloak client secret) - never committed.
.env
# The frontend's .env is different: nothing but public base paths and timing defaults,
# and the dev server is broken without it - so it ships. (Discovered the hard way: a fresh
# clone's `npm run dev` proxied nothing, because Vite fell back to base "/" while the
# backend lives at /bff-kickstart-api.)
!frontend/.env
.DS_Store
